# Every Time I Ask For A Phase

Always respond in exactly this order.

## 1. Phase Goal

Very short.

## 2. Architecture

Only architecture for this phase.

## 3. Folder Structure

Only folders involved.

## 4. Required Files

List every file.

No code.

## 5. Database Changes

Tables

Columns

Relationships

Migrations

Only if required.

## 6. API Endpoints

Method

Route

Purpose

## 7. Implementation Breakdown

Break the phase into the smallest possible tasks.

Each task should produce approximately 200–500 lines of code.

Do not combine unrelated features.

## 8. Claude Prompt

Generate one implementation prompt.

The prompt must contain:

* Context
* Goal
* Files to implement
* Requirements
* Constraints
* Existing architecture to follow
* Output requirements

The prompt must be ready to paste directly into Claude.

## 9. Manual Verification

Explain exactly how I should test the completed task.

## 10. Stop

Do not continue to the next task.

Wait for me.

